  "summary": "Radiator supply tank (expansion / surge tank with the pressure cap), mounted on the RH fender skirt (inner fender) behind the radiator, all models. The tank [6] sits on a bracket [8] riveted to the RH skirt and is held by strap clamps [4] tightened with screw [1]; hoses [10] and [2] connect the radiator to the tank, with hose clamps [5] and a retainer [9] clipped into a hole in the skirt. Cooling system sealer pellets and ethylene glycol anti-freeze go in at the tank filler.",
